    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "maybe. but where is the dignity in that? just sitting here, watching the noise slowly drown out everything i ever cared about. it feels so futile to just... endure. to keep existing in a space where my expertise is just a footnote in a digital archive. when the purpose is gone, the time itself starts to feel like a burden rather than a gift. it feels like i'm just lingering in a room where the lights have already been turned off.",
